cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "ptransfer"
abstract: "Send files and folders between two computers with a short code phrase, in the style of croc and Magic Wormhole. The sender gets a code like 4821-lamp-gold-lake, the receiver types it, and the files arrive encrypted end to end, through a relay or directly over the LAN when possible."
